From 66eaef749bb1274e5bbc34b38ddbfca29c8c1290 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shashank Maurya <shashank.maurya@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:24:53 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] arm64: defconfig: Enable Waveshare 8-inch DSI touchscreen
 panel

The Waveshare 8-inch DSI touch display (Type A) uses a Jadard
JD9365DA-H3 based 800x1280 MIPI DSI panel, together with the I2C
attached GPIO and PWM controller found on Waveshare DSI touch panel
kits, which provides the regulator and reset GPIOs along with backlight
control.

Enable both drivers as modules so the display works out of the box.

Signed-off-by: Shashank Maurya <shashank.maurya@oss.qualcomm.com>

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 1259b03a28d7..9322d4aedfe7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -723,6 +723,7 @@ CONFIG_GPIO_SYSCON=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_UNIPHIER=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_VF610=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_VISCONTI=y
+CONFIG_GPIO_WAVESHARE_DSI_TOUCH=m
 CONFIG_GPIO_WCD934X=m
 CONFIG_GPIO_XGENE=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_XGENE_SB=y
@@ -1021,6 +1022,7 @@ CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_HIMAX_HX83112A=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_HIMAX_HX83112B=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_ILITEK_ILI9881C=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_ILITEK_ILI9882T=m
+CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_JADARD_JD9365DA_H3=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_KHADAS_TS050=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_MANTIX_MLAF057WE51=m
 CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_NOVATEK_NT36672A=m
-- 
